# RealinApi Test Requests

# These are sample HTTP requests for testing the API endpoints
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or tools like Postman/Insomnia

### Health Check
GET https://localhost:5001/health

### Google Login
POST https://localhost:5001/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN_FROM_CLIENT",
  "deviceInfo": "iPhone 15 Pro"
}

### Apple Login
POST https://localhost:5001/api/auth/apple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "APPLE_ID_TOKEN_FROM_CLIENT",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "deviceInfo": "iPhone 15 Pro"
}

### Request OTP via Email
POST https://localhost:5001/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": null,
  "method": "email"
}

### Request OTP via SMS
POST https://localhost:5001/api/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": null,
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "method": "sms"
}

### Verify OTP (Email)
POST https://localhost:5001/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": null,
  "code": "123456",
  "deviceInfo": "iPhone 15 Pro"
}

### Verify OTP (SMS)
POST https://localhost:5001/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": null,
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "code": "123456",
  "deviceInfo": "iPhone 15 Pro"
}

### Refresh Token
POST https://localhost:5001/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Protected Endpoint Example (after login)
# GET https://localhost:5001/api/protected
# Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
